{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb Race Mode is here!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's time to settle the score in a 1v1 race to the top. Enter the race-exclusive stage with your friend!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you take the turtle path, steady and reliable, or the rabbit path, risky but fast? The moment you choose, the race has already begun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It\u2019s Finally Here! Multiplayer Mode Unlocked! Grab a friend by the Crowbar and Climb to the Top \u2013 Together!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285300/extras/df3440dd1cf8f2aafd84a611163e4ba5.poster.avif?t=1773375262\" width=534 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285300/extras/df3440dd1cf8f2aafd84a611163e4ba5.webm?t=1773375262\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285300/extras/df3440dd1cf8f2aafd84a611163e4ba5.mp4?t=1773375262\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game is a challenge for all VR gamers who love physics and brain teasers.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For VR gamers who are strong in both mind and arm... see you at the top!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcaaYour hands are crowbars\u2014ready to start climbing\ud83d\udcaa</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Crowbar Climber</i>, use your crowbars to make your way up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face hooks, planks, and gears using only your arms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you beat the game before you run out of energy?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285300/extras/feecb70e59eaa45724d412abac16d1f9.poster.avif?t=1773375262\" width=534 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285300/extras/feecb70e59eaa45724d412abac16d1f9.webm?t=1773375262\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285300/extras/feecb70e59eaa45724d412abac16d1f9.mp4?t=1773375262\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\uddd7\u200d\u2642\ufe0fMaster the art of climbing through physics!\ud83e\uddd7\u200d\u2640\ufe0f</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control your environment and body using a crowbar that reacts to every move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab hooks at the last second, launch yourself with powerful swings, and cling to ledges in creative ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285300/extras/ff4582466d14d300cfa77414bd0af19d.poster.avif?t=1773375262\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285300/extras/ff4582466d14d300cfa77414bd0af19d.webm?t=1773375262\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285300/extras/ff4582466d14d300cfa77414bd0af19d.mp4?t=1773375262\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcf7Share your gameplay videos with friends!\ud83c\udfa5</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Record both first-person and third-person perspectives, just like in the promo video.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show off your crowbar-climbing skills to friends or share on social media.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285300/extras/ff43d56aa9c0b4921c64bfaf5af365bb.poster.avif?t=1773375262\" width=674 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285300/extras/ff43d56aa9c0b4921c64bfaf5af365bb.webm?t=1773375262\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285300/extras/ff43d56aa9c0b4921c64bfaf5af365bb.mp4?t=1773375262\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3285300?t=1773375262","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285300/2d5e50252764e065435ba704408ebd47f82ac351/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773375262","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285300/b467b1b215bd426e07e29129fb36d4fc1e680619/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773375262","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285300/b467b1b215bd426e07e29129fb36d4fc1e680619/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773375262","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb Race Mode is here!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's time to settle the score in a 1v1 race to the top. Enter the race-exclusive stage with your friend!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you take the turtle path, steady and reliable, or the rabbit path, risky but fast? The moment you choose, the race has already begun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragrap